sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SDK as S3 SDK
  participant GW as Rust S3 Gateway
  participant AUTH as IAM/KMS/Quota
  participant META as Raft Object Catalog
  participant EC as EC Encode/Storage Nodes
  SDK->>GW: PUT Bucket/Key SigV4 Stream
  GW->>AUTH: verify SigV4, policy, retention, quota
  AUTH-->>GW: permission+policy_epoch
  GW->>META: prepare_put(key,routeEpoch,OperationId)
  META-->>GW: signed ticket & placement
  GW->>GW: stream SHA-256 / checksum
  GW->>EC: stripe data + parity writes
  EC->>EC: fsync fragments / validate integrity
  EC-->>GW: all required durability receipts
  GW->>META: commit_put(manifest,receipts,OperationId)
  META->>META: raft quorum commit ObjectVersion+Head+AuditOutbox
  META-->>GW: committed LogicalVersionId
  GW-->>SDK: 200 + ETag + version header
  Note over SDK,META: If timeout before HTTP ACK, retry must lookup OperationId
